    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754371
    m_Localized: Tank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754372
    m_Localized: 'Light and quick off the line, cuts across grass. Fragile: avoid
      contact, dodge and drift.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754373
    m_Localized: 'The all-rounder: balanced speed, grip and armor. Hold the racing
      line and fight when it pays.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754374
    m_Localized: 'Heavy and tough, wins every shove. Slow to stop: brake early, then
      ram.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006398797754375
    m_Localized: Slow on tarmac, but its tracks barely slow down on grass. Huge armor;
      the turret swings twice as wide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
