  - m_Id: 18182514288177152
    m_Localized: All
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954368
    m_Localized: Ranged
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954369
    m_Localized: Close combat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954370
    m_Localized: Control
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954371
    m_Localized: Traps
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954372
    m_Localized: Wide spread. Get close to land more pellets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954373
    m_Localized: Several projectiles per shot. Keep the rival centered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954374
    m_Localized: Fast sustained fire. Release the trigger to manage heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954375
    m_Localized: Powerful, slow shots. Aim carefully during the firing pause.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954376
    m_Localized: The rocket follows a target ahead. Fire with a clear line of sight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954377
    m_Localized: Bounces off walls. Use barriers to reach awkward angles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954378
    m_Localized: Pulls the rival toward you. Stay in range and watch your driving
      line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954379
    m_Localized: "Magazine: {n} \xB7 reload: {seconds} s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954380
    m_Localized: "No magazine reload \xB7 watch the heat"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954381
    m_Localized: 'Range: {n} m'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954382
    m_Localized: 'Effect radius: {n} m'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18182514304954383
    m_Localized: '{effect}: {seconds} s'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820457320448
    m_Localized: 'Gas: W / up. Reverse: S / down. Steer: A/D or arrows. Brake: Space.
      Return to the track: R.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097664
    m_Localized: The car accelerates itself. Steer with the arrows. Hold BRAKE to
      slow down. Tap R to return to the track.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097665
    m_Localized: 'Fire: Ctrl / left mouse. Swap your two weapons: Q / mouse wheel,
      or keys 1 and 2.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097666
    m_Localized: "Fire: Ctrl / left mouse. Hold Q and move the mouse to select a
      weapon; release Q to equip it. While holding Q, use Tab / mouse wheel for pages
      and 1\u20130 for slots."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097667
    m_Localized: Hold FIRE to shoot. Tap SWAP to cycle through the weapons available
      in your loadout.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097668
    m_Localized: '{action}: E / Shift / right mouse / LB. Ammo and readiness are
      shown on the HUD.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097669
    m_Localized: Tap {action} to use your secondary weapon. Ammo and readiness are
      shown on the HUD.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097670
    m_Localized: With a charge planted, press the same control again to detonate
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820474097671
    m_Localized: 'Gamepad: left stick to steer; RT / LT for gas / reverse; A to brake;
      Y to return to the track.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820478291968
    m_Localized: 'Gamepad: RB to fire; D-pad down / up selects weapon slots 1 / 2.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820478291969
    m_Localized: Only mines. Get ahead, then press E / Shift / right mouse to drop
      a mine behind you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18240820478291970
    m_Localized: Only mines. Get ahead and tap MINE to leave a trap for your pursuers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18675088652316672
    m_Localized: 'THIS RACE: {n}/3 STARS'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18675088660705280
    m_Localized: Earned this race
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18675088660705281
    m_Localized: "Previously earned \xB7 kept"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18675088660705282
    m_Localized: Not earned this race
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18826098154745856
    m_Localized: 'The road changes each lap: barriers disappear on lap 2; the road
      narrows on lap 3. Stay near the centre.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18826098205077504
    m_Localized: 'Pass through the glowing rings for a boost. The road has no barriers:
      line up before accelerating.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18826098205077505
    m_Localized: 'Lap 2: barriers gone. Keep clear of the edges!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18826098205077506
    m_Localized: 'Lap 3: the road is narrower. Aim for the centre!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
